{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LXjUKrNKAysbjVFm75vZ5r","type":"tool_result","content":"# Vibe Code Web Session Limits and Daily Quotas\n\n## Session Limits\n\nAccording to the documentation:\n\n- **Maximum duration:** \"24 hours\"\n- **Inactivity timeout:** \"3 hours\" while awaiting user input\n- **Concurrent sessions:** Plan-dependent\n\n## Daily Quotas\n\nThe platform enforces different usage limits based on user type:\n\n- **Free users:** \"2 sessions per day, where access is enabled\"\n- **Paid users:** \"100 sessions per day\"\n\nBoth session limits and daily quotas may vary depending on your specific plan and rollout status."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"539cacdc-2e48-4ba3-b4b0-e5e4a8a2ae1c","uuid":"fde985a8-61c7-4bbf-9307-72c86588e1a2","timestamp":"2026-09-11T19:44:05.709Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":1148742,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Vibe Code Web Session Limits and Daily Quotas\n\n## Session Limits\n\nAccording to the documentation:\n\n- **Maximum duration:** \"24 hours\"\n- **Inactivity timeout:** \"3 hours\" while awaiting user input\n- **Concurrent sessions:** Plan-dependent\n\n## Daily Quotas\n\nThe platform enforces different usage limits based on user type:\n\n- **Free users:** \"2 sessions per day, where access is enabled\"\n- **Paid users:** \"100 sessions per day\"\n\nBoth session limits and daily quotas may vary depending on your specific plan and rollout status.","durationMs":2717,"url":"https://docs.mistral.ai/vibe/code/vibe-code-web/limits-and-lifecycle"}}
